WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.600
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:09.400
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:01:56.090 --> 00:01:57.290
<i>My name is Lief.</i>

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:03.300
<i>Together with my companions, Barda and Jasmine, I defeated several terrifying monsters and recovered six gems.</i>

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:07.760
<i>But to be honest, when I left the Forests of Silence to go on a journey with a stubborn old guy,</i>

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:07.730
<i>Hey!</i>

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:10.500
<i>along with this unreliable boy,</i>

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:10.260
<i>What was that?</i>

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:12.900
<i>I could only hope that
everything would be alright.</i>

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:17.100
<i>But by working together,
we've finally made it this far!</i>

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:19.140
<i>There's only one gem remaining!</i>

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:24.900
<i>Our last perilous destination, The Valley of the Lost where the diamond is hidden, is just right ahead!</i>

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:38.400
This body is as beautiful as the previous one.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:44.100
As one would expect of your
magic, my Shadow Lord.

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:48.540
However, Sorceress Thaegan...

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:53.480
This will be the last time the
Shadow Lord grants you new life.

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:57.830
So you had best take care of those
three pests this time, alright?

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:00.810
I do not take orders from you!

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:03.300
Rae Exalaedus,

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:05.200
Imu Dominum Sedolak,

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:06.200
Thaegan!

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:13.900
Sorceress Thaegan.

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:16.740
Your revival this time
is not without condition.

00:03:16.740 --> 00:03:21.200
With each failure on your journey,
that beauty of yours will slowly break down.

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:27.170
If you don't like it, then try not to
fail in killing those three this time.

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:30.380
You keep your mouth shut...!

00:03:37.180 --> 00:03:40.020
This is your final chance.

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:42.020
Be sure not to forget it.

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:06.300
I'm so exhausted...

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:10.420
Hang in there, Jasmine.

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:14.720
We just need to get through this forest and
cross the river to reach our destination!

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:17.760
And the last gem will be waiting for us there.

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:22.900
But anyway, this forest is a bit
gloomy and creepy, don't you think?

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:26.700
Even Kree seems to be afraid of something...

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:30.430
Yes, I can't say that this place is too pleasant.

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:33.200
Then let's not linger here.

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:35.280
This forest is definitely a shortcut.

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:47.620
Hey, look over there!

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:52.560
I wonder what this means...

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:53.400
'D'?

00:04:54.070 --> 00:04:54.800
Yeah.

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:56.720
The letter D is carved in there.

00:04:57.780 --> 00:04:59.220
Come to think of it, 'D' is...!

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:01.540
It could be D for 'Dain'!

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:04.920
Could it be that Dain left this mark for us?

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:06.360
That must be it!

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:09.800
Dain must be trying to tell us
his whereabouts with this!

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:13.200
Now wait, you two.

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:19.200
My thinking is that it may very well be
a trap set by those who <i>took</i> Dain.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:25.000
There's a chance that someone out there is using
Dain as bait to lead us into their hands.

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:30.200
But, even if it really is a trap...

00:05:31.110 --> 00:05:36.060
I think that as long as there's also a chance that
this is from the real Dain, then we must go!

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:37.880
I agree with Lief!

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:40.400
Either way, we can't just ignore this mark!

00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:46.260
If that's how you both feel,
then let's give it a try.

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:47.100
Yeah!

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:47.100
-Yeah!

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:53.100
Sorceress Thaegan gulps her favourite food,

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:55.800
in her cave with all her brood.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:59.000
And the names of her children are,

00:05:59.720 --> 00:06:01.300
Hot, Tot, Jin!

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:04.000
Jod, Fie, Fly!

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:07.800
Zan, Zod, Pik, Snik, Lun, Lod!

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:10.600
And last of all the dreaded Ichabod!

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:15.410
It's been a while, my children.

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:17.740
Mama! Mama!!

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:19.400
Did you behave yourselves?

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:21.620
I'm so glad to see Mama again!

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:25.000
And Mama somehow looks
even more beautiful now!

00:06:26.390 --> 00:06:27.760
Really now?

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:31.070
Hey Mama! Play with me! Play with me!

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:32.990
No can do, I'm the first in line!

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:34.560
No, I'm first!

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:36.000
I will be the first!

00:06:37.780 --> 00:06:39.650
Hey, Mama...

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:43.000
What's the matter, Ichabod?

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:47.820
Have you become smitten with me now that
I've returned more beautiful than ever?

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:53.820
What a cute child. Your
face has gotten all red.

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:59.050
A-Anyway, you came here because you need something from us, right?

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:02.220
That's exactly right, Ichabod.

00:07:02.550 --> 00:07:07.310
You see, Mama has something that
she really needs to do this time.

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:10.810
So, you'll all lend a hand, won't you?

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:14.200
Of course we will, Mama!

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:16.550
We'll go through fire
and water for you, Mama!

00:07:16.550 --> 00:07:18.610
I'll transform into anything for Mama!

00:07:18.610 --> 00:07:19.730
Me as well!

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.380
I can do that much myself too!

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:31.640
You're all such good children.

00:07:38.030 --> 00:07:40.500
Look! There's another one over there!

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:45.200
On that tree too!

00:07:49.340 --> 00:07:51.020
I can see another one up ahead!

00:07:58.070 --> 00:07:59.580
They fell for it! They fell for it!

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:02.180
We've tricked them completely!

00:08:03.390 --> 00:08:06.000
It's all thanks to me and my good carving!

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:13.330
Bah, I can do better than that.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:25.810
Yes, perfect. Keep leading
them just like that.

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:29.700
Hey Mama, what will we do to
them after we lead them here?

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:30.920
Can we eat them?

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:32.500
I want to eat them! I want to eat them!

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:35.210
We didn't get to eat them last time, after all!

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:37.880
Of course. You can all have a taste.

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:42.160
We'll slowly barbecue them this time,
roasting them until they're well-done.

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:43.900
Hooray! Hooray!

00:08:43.900 --> 00:08:45.580
We finally get to eat them now!

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:49.900
The big man would be great!
He's definitely going to fill my belly!

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:53.030
No he's not! He's <i>my</i> prey after all!

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:55.810
Don't you dare! I saw
him first, so he's mine!

00:08:55.810 --> 00:08:57.560
No! He's mine! Mine!

00:08:57.560 --> 00:08:59.700
Cut it out, you two!

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.600
That's right.

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:04.480
You're siblings, so you need to
learn to share and get along.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:05.790
Alright...

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:07.740
I'm sorry, Mama...

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:12.760
This is time, it's my final chance.

00:09:13.140 --> 00:09:17.240
I must kill those three without
fail, no matter what it takes.

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:19.520
Or else, I'll be...!

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:22.520
What would happen to you, Mama?

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:26.400
Never mind that and just do as I say!

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:30.380
Hurry up and lead them to this place!

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:33.510
Ma...ma...

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:40.660
Sure, Mama has become prettier now,
but she's also become a lot scarier too...

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:43.370
She used to be really kind to us...

00:09:43.370 --> 00:09:49.020
Our Mama who's kind, beautiful, and with
powerful magic... Our pride and joy...

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:50.800
She sure has changed...

00:09:52.410 --> 00:09:54.320
It's those guys' fault!

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:58.990
As long as they're alive,
Mama will never rest!

00:09:59.380 --> 00:10:03.580
I'll definitely eat them! I'll devour
every single piece of their flesh,

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:06.480
until there's nothing left of them!

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:12.100
Then I'm sure that Mama will turn back
into our kind and beautiful Mama again!

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:19.310
Come on! We're going too! We'll definitely
capture them, no matter what!

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:20.350
Yeah!

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:49.900
Are you two doing alright?

00:10:50.220 --> 00:10:53.200
How about you, Lief?
You're breathing heavily...

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:58.910
Well, we <i>have</i> been walking
endlessly after all. Shall we rest?

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:39.820
Just kill me! I'm not afraid
to die for Lief's sake!

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:40.800
That's right!

00:11:42.040 --> 00:11:45.500
No matter what happens to me,
I will definitely protect Lief!

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:02.000
So it was a dream...?

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:07.860
It couldn't be...

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:12.100
Was that a vision of the future
that the opal showed me?

00:12:27.450 --> 00:12:29.700
Lief, is something the matter?

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.690
You've been really quiet since this morning.

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:34.900
I'm fine.

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:37.130
Then, why so withdrawn?

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:39.970
Do you have something on your mind?

00:12:40.770 --> 00:12:41.700
It's nothing...

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:49.000
Above?!

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:10.900
I'll be the one to take it on!

00:13:12.010 --> 00:13:13.200
<i>Just kill me!</i>

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:16.500
<i>I'm not afraid to die for Lief's sake!</i>

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:19.600
You can't!

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:21.500
I'll fight too, Barda!

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:29.160
Take this...!

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:35.240
Lief! Use this chance to escape!

00:13:35.610 --> 00:13:37.740
No! I will fight too!

00:13:37.740 --> 00:13:39.860
I can't just abandon you both!

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:40.900
Stop!

00:13:41.940 --> 00:13:42.730
Watch out!

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:46.980
Jasmine!

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:51.920
Run, Lief!

00:13:51.920 --> 00:13:53.010
Hurry up!

00:13:53.010 --> 00:13:55.250
No! I can't do that!

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:57.260
I won't leave you two behind here!!

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:02.200
Lief!!

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:19.600
We did it! We did it!

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:21.240
We caught them all!

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:22.450
They look so delicious!

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:24.120
Let's eat them already!

00:14:24.120 --> 00:14:25.700
Alright, time to eat!

00:14:26.360 --> 00:14:27.740
Me first!

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:29.340
Don't you dare!

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:30.900
I'm first!

00:14:30.900 --> 00:14:34.950
Stop it! We need to show
them to Mama first!

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:36.800
Wait, aren't these guys...

00:14:36.800 --> 00:14:38.640
Thaegan's children...?!

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:40.640
That's right! We tricked you!

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:46.600
I was the one who carved those D's.
They looked pretty cool, don't you think?

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:47.500
Shit!

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:49.640
So it really was a trap?!

00:14:50.020 --> 00:14:51.950
How dare you deceive us!

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:54.410
Using Dain to trick us was so low!

00:14:55.810 --> 00:14:58.510
Blame yourselves for getting fooled.

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:02.770
Precisely.

00:15:04.490 --> 00:15:07.050
It's your own fault for being fooled.

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:08.750
T-Thaegan?!

00:15:08.890 --> 00:15:09.910
Mama!

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:11.430
We did it, Mama!

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:13.480
We caught them this time!

00:15:13.480 --> 00:15:16.200
She has revived again...?!

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:24.700
My life and beauty will go on for eternity, never to be snuffed out, you see.

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:26.900
What a stubborn sorceress!

00:15:27.060 --> 00:15:27.890
Silence!

00:15:32.880 --> 00:15:33.580
Barda!

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:34.890
Are you okay?

00:15:34.890 --> 00:15:35.700
Yeah...

00:15:37.280 --> 00:15:41.100
It seems that her magic is
even stronger than before...!

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:43.910
What should we do now?
At this rate, we'll...!

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:48.680
At the very least, we need to make sure that Lief can escape from this place...!

00:15:50.150 --> 00:15:52.480
What are you mumbling about over there?!

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:55.420
Yeah! Keep quiet!

00:15:56.190 --> 00:15:57.680
This is all your fault, Lief!

00:15:57.680 --> 00:15:58.220
Huh?

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:01.800
We would have killed it had you
followed normal routine and

00:16:01.800 --> 00:16:05.300
let Barda draw the enemy's attention while you focused on attacking with me!

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:08.500
She's right, Lief.

00:16:08.930 --> 00:16:11.300
You're acting very strange today.

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:13.500
Did something happen?

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:15.730
<i>They're right...</i>

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:21.700
<i>If only I had fought like usual, we
wouldn't have ended up like this...!</i>

00:16:22.720 --> 00:16:26.700
Now then, I wonder what we
should do with these three?

00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:29.490
Let's whole-roast the big guy!

00:16:29.490 --> 00:16:32.480
Or even better, let's put
that thin boy in a soup!

00:16:32.480 --> 00:16:35.890
And let's mince the girl and
make her into a delicious stew!

00:16:39.050 --> 00:16:42.780
You've been causing a lot of trouble for me since we first met, after all.

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:46.660
It wouldn't be fair to deny you the most intense anguish you've ever felt,

00:16:46.660 --> 00:16:50.300
from now until your very last breath, right?

00:16:52.060 --> 00:16:55.210
You guys are strong when united as three.

00:16:55.210 --> 00:16:59.120
Indeed, the same can be
said of my children, you see?

00:17:00.070 --> 00:17:01.200
However,

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:05.000
when you three are
separated from one another...

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:06.800
I wonder what will happen then?

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:08.700
No way...

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:14.700
So that dream really <i>was</i> a vision
of the future from the opal...?!

00:17:15.690 --> 00:17:17.790
What do you intend to do to us?!

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:24.400
Let's see... I suppose I'll start with removing the
noisy little girl who's been yapping all this time.

00:17:36.340 --> 00:17:37.100
What the...?!

00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:38.330
Jasmine!

00:17:38.880 --> 00:17:42.070
You damned sorceress!
Where did you send Jasmine?!

00:17:42.070 --> 00:17:48.060
Are you sure this is the time to be
taking that tone with me, Big Guy?

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:54.580
Barda!!

00:17:57.080 --> 00:17:58.720
And for you...

00:18:00.280 --> 00:18:05.170
To tell you the truth, you're my
favourite among the three of you.

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:07.630
How sickening!

00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:09.160
How dare you!

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:13.510
What's so unpleasant about
being liked by Mama?!

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:18.900
I have always felt a dangerous power that I
can't quite describe lingering within you.

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:23.260
Something powerful enough
to put even myself on edge.

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:26.960
That's why, I'm going to let you
sample the greatest torment of all.

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:31.860
Something that is certain to make you
regret ever having been born in this world.

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:42.800
So, where did you end
up sending them, Mama?

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:45.090
I really wanted to eat them, though...

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:47.800
I'll let you eat them later, don't worry.

00:18:47.800 --> 00:18:51.700
After the marinade called "agony" has soaked into their flesh, that is.

00:18:52.680 --> 00:18:54.100
Now!

00:18:54.100 --> 00:18:55.960
My children!

00:18:55.960 --> 00:18:58.700
Combine your strength
and make them suffer!

00:18:59.460 --> 00:19:03.830
And of course, there will be a reward for the fastest one to kill them!

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:06.820
Okay, Mama!

00:19:06.820 --> 00:19:08.580
I'll do my best!

00:19:09.070 --> 00:19:10.500
So will I!

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:19.910
Huh?!

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:25.850
You needn't go with them, Ichabod.

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:27.630
Huh? But why not?

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:34.060
Because I know that you've never been very
good at working together with your siblings.

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:37.320
I also know that you can
handle them on your own.

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:39.220
So stay here for me, okay?

00:19:39.220 --> 00:19:42.230
Okay, if that's what Mama wants, then...

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:46.300
You're such a good boy, Ichabod.

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:12.700
Oh... It's just a mirror...

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:32.190
N-No way...!

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:40.710
Another... me...?

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:44.000
That's right. I am you.

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:50.950
Who's there?!

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:58.140
Prandine?!

00:20:58.800 --> 00:21:03.600
That's right, I am indeed the very
man that you hated most!

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:12.800
Just what's going on here?!

00:21:20.900 --> 00:21:23.180
Now, memorise the pattern.

00:21:23.180 --> 00:21:24.500
Yeah, memorise it!

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:28.540
If you can't build it in the exact same way...

00:21:28.540 --> 00:21:31.090
...you'll be boiled alive inside this cage!

00:21:37.010 --> 00:21:40.090
Now, let us have a duel,
right here and now,

00:21:40.090 --> 00:21:44.600
to decide which of the two
of us is the real Lief, shall we?

00:21:52.860 --> 00:21:58.680
You see, this mirror is able to make reality
the thing that the target most despises.

00:21:59.360 --> 00:22:05.660
So I'm sure those three must be suffering by now,
given that they're having to face exactly that.

00:22:06.570 --> 00:22:08.410
Doesn't it sound wonderful?

00:22:08.800 --> 00:22:10.200
Yeah.

00:22:11.000 --> 00:22:12.800
It's really exciting.

00:22:13.730 --> 00:22:18.200
Suffering and writhing in
agony as they die in obscurity...

00:22:18.700 --> 00:22:23.630
A perfectly suitable end for those
three, wouldn't you agree?

00:24:07.350 --> 00:24:08.620
Transformation Magic.

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:15.230
<i>Thanks to the powerful magic
they acquired from Thaegan,</i>

00:24:15.460 --> 00:24:19.910
<i>Thaegan's children are able to transform into various things and attack Lief and the others.</i>

00:24:20.520 --> 00:24:23.300
I duelled against a fake me.

00:24:23.300 --> 00:24:25.520
Jasmine pitted her intellect
against building blocks.

00:24:25.520 --> 00:24:28.470
And Barda fought against Prandine,
whom we thought to be dead.

00:24:28.470 --> 00:24:31.800
Will we be able to overcome this ordeal?

00:24:30.940 --> 00:24:34.810
Thaegan and Her Children

00:24:32.320 --> 00:24:34.810
Next time, 'Thaegan and Her Children'.

00:24:49.860 --> 00:24:54.800
See you next time
